    <string name="welcome_title">wĩtĩkĩrio thĩinĩ wa ylih</string>
    <string name="welcome_intro">ylih nĩĩandĩkaga ĩgita rĩrĩa o kĩrĩndĩ kĩa iria bia gũthikĩria gĩkaraga gĩunganĩte, nĩguo mĩaka ĩngĩ ũkiuma ũkĩhota gũcokia kĩũria kĩmwe kĩrĩa kĩrĩ na bata: nĩ mathaa maigana maraikarire?</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_title">unganĩria ũrĩkie ũriganĩrwe</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_body">iria bia gũthikĩria bia bluetooth nĩbiandĩkagwa biene, kuuma ĩgita rĩrĩa biunganaga. gũtirĩ kĩndũ gĩkwagĩrĩirwe gũtigwa gĩkĩruta wĩra.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">kĩrĩndĩ kĩmwe, muturire ũmwe</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">rĩrĩa kĩrĩndĩ gĩakua, gĩthirie wĩra: namba yakĩo nĩĩrũgamaga hau na kĩrĩndĩ kĩngĩ kĩa iria bĩu kĩambĩrĩria rĩngĩ kuuma nthĩ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">waya na gũina</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire, thĩinĩ wa mĩthemba, nĩkuongagĩra iria bia waya na gũthima ĩgita rĩrĩa rĩainire na ma.</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy">indo ciothe ciikaraga thimũ ĩno. gũtirĩ akaũnti, na app ĩtirĩ rũtha rwa intaneti.</string>
    <string name="welcome_start">ambĩrĩria</string>
    <string name="welcome_next">kĩrĩa kĩngĩ</string>
    <string name="welcome_allow">ĩtĩkĩria</string>
    <string name="welcome_step">ĩtambo %1$d kuuma %2$d</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">rũtha rwa bluetooth</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android nĩĩĩraga app kĩndũ kĩrĩkũ kĩa bluetooth kĩunganĩte, na rĩĩtwa rĩakĩo, ũngĩ app ĩrĩ na rũtha rwa bluetooth. ũu nĩguo ylih ĩmenyaga kĩrĩndĩ kĩa iria bia gũthikĩria kuuma redio ya ngari, na ĩkamenya kĩrĩndĩ kĩmwe kuuma kĩngĩ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">na rũu: o kĩrĩndĩ nĩkĩandĩkagwo kuuma ĩgita rĩrĩa kĩunganaga, gũtarĩ kĩndũ gĩgũtigwa gĩkĩruta wĩra na gũtarĩ kĩndũ gĩa kũririkana kũhũria.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">gũtarĩ rũu: gũtirĩ iria bia bluetooth ciandĩkagwo. indo iria ingĩ cia app nĩirutaga wĩra, na no ũrũheane thutha thĩinĩ wa mĩthemba ya app cia android.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">mĩmenyithia</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire nĩkũrutaga wĩra ũnini na thutha, na android nĩĩbataraga app o yothe ĩkũruta ũguo ĩige mũmenyithia ũkuoneka ĩgita rĩu.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">na mĩo: mũmenyithia nĩwonagia kĩrĩa gĩkũandĩkwo rĩu, na kĩu nĩkĩo kĩmenyithia kĩmwe kĩa atĩ kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire nĩ kũrĩ muoyo.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">gũtarĩ mĩo: kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire nĩkũrutaga wĩra na gũgĩandĩka. android no ĩtikonania mũmenyithia wakuo.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">nĩĩthiaga na mbere gũtara ũgĩkĩriganĩrwo</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android nĩĩrũgamagia app iria itahingũrĩtwo mĩeri ĩmwe na ĩgacokia rũtha rwacio, ũndũ ũngĩtiga ylih ĩtekwandĩka kĩndũ nginya ũkĩhingũre rĩngĩ. kũriganĩrwo nĩkĩo gĩtũmi kĩa app ĩno, kwoguo nĩ wega kũhoria ũu rĩu.</string>
