    <string name="settings_tracking">kũrũmĩrĩra</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_title">kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">nĩkuongagĩra iria bia waya na ĩgita rĩa gũina. android nĩĩmenyithagia ũhoro wa waya app ĩrĩa ĩkũruta wĩra ĩiki, kwoguo ũyũ ũigaga mũmenyithia ũtarĩ mũgambo. bluetooth nĩĩrũmagĩrĩrwo o na kũrĩ ũguo.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">gũtirĩ nginya rũtha rwa bluetooth rũheanwo: mwako ũyũ ũmenyithagia mũthemba wa connectedDevice ũiki, ũrĩa android 14+ ĩoheaga na rũtha rwa bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">tara gũina kwiki</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">namba itaraga ĩgita rĩrĩa mũgambo waina na ma handũ ha ĩgita rĩa kũunganĩrwo. magita marĩa maandĩkirwo kũrũmĩrĩra kũrĩa kwĩgereire kũrĩ kũhingũre moiki nĩmathimire gũina; marĩa mangĩ nĩmatigagwo.</string>
