    <string name="settings_troubleshooting">gũthondeka mathĩna</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_body">magita mangĩtiga kwandĩkwo, rora kana ylih nĩĩrekeirio kuuma kũnyihia betiri — app ĩrĩa ĩrũgamĩtio na hinya ndĩcokaga kwamũkĩra mĩmenyithia ya kũunganĩrwo nginya ĩhingũrwo.</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_button">mĩthemba ya betiri</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_path">mĩthemba → app → ylih → betiri → gũtarĩ mũhaka.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_body">ylih ĩngĩaga kũhingũrwo mĩeri ĩmwe, android nĩĩmĩrũgamagia na ĩgacokia rũtha rwayo, na gũtirĩ kĩndũ gĩcokaga kwandĩkwo nginya ũmĩhingũre. kũhoria ũu nĩkuo gũtũmaga kĩrĩndĩ gĩthiĩ na mbere gũtara ĩgita rĩothe rĩrĩa ũtekũririkana app.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_on">android no ĩrũgamie ylih.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_off">ylih nĩĩrekeirio na ĩgũthiĩ na mbere kwandĩka.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_button">mĩthemba ya app itarahũthĩrwo</string>
