    <string name="settings_about_body">ylih %1$s (%2$s) — mathaa ma iria bia gũthikĩria, maigĩtwo haha na tene na tene.</string>
    <string name="settings_import_confirm_title">garũra ũhoro wothe?</string>
    <string name="settings_import_confirm_body">kwĩkĩra bakabu ĩno kũniinaga o kĩndũ, kĩrĩndĩ na ĩgita rĩrĩa rĩrĩ ho rĩu.</string>

